    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχραντος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>undefiled, immaculate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1574
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1025
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίτρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.73
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμψύχου βρώσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.648
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεκμήριον καθαρὸν καὶ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.113e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἰδέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
